  "decision_conditions": [
    "Notwithstanding the details of materials on the application form, the stud tiles to the existing front and rear dormers and the existing roof tiles shall be replaced with Marley concrete plain roof tiles in Smooth Grey unless otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.",
